{"id":"u-78a61f33-9b21-4692-acc2-522e1d848862","src":"community","title":"Full Body - Bench & Pull up","author":"Tim Guzman","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Xr1Z4u-full-body-bench-and-biceps","desc":"This 6-week hybrid program is built for men who want to get stronger, build an impressive upper body, and stay athletic without spending their whole week in the gym. The main focus is increasing bench press and pull-up strength while driving hypertrophy in the chest, shoulders, arms, and back through a mix of heavy barbell work, bodyweight training, and targeted volume.\n\nThe program combines bench specialization, weighted pull-ups, incline pressing, dips, calisthenics, lower-body maintenance, and built-in cardio to create a complete fitness system. It is designed for the guy who wants to look strong, be strong, and stay healthy enough to perform in real life. This is not just a bodybuilding split and not just a strength plan. It is a balanced hybrid built to improve performance, physique, and conditioning at the same time.\n\nJust as important, the workouts are efficient and realistic. You are not spending six days a week grinding away in the gym for hours. The training is structured to give you the highest return on your time, so you can build strength and muscle, improve conditioning, and still have a life outside the gym.\n\nBy the end of the 6 weeks, the goal is simple: a stronger bench, stronger pull-ups, a bigger and more muscular upper body, and a body that still moves, runs, climbs, and performs.","level":["Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-23T14:50:19.225Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5","Day 6"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":1,"rpe":8,"x":3},{"r":4,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Squat (Low Bar)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":1,"